{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118135057255-1118_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261118151443\"/><p>窗戶火光熊熊，冒出黑煙。</p><p>粉嶺發生火警。今午(18日)1時38分，華明邨富明樓一單位起火，火舌及濃煙竄出窗外，消防員接報到場灌救，同時派出搜救隊到場協助救援，消防迅速將火勢救熄。事件中，約16名住客自行疏散，幸無人受傷。消息指，廚房雜物起火，消防正調查火警原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.626704+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:50:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:57:16.433418+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T07:21:13.616738+00:00","content_hash":"61216bd68be277bd3fca24f4aadd31f10a23471d7af47df58920592f06c7bdba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T07:27:40.626704+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}